The commits include the eight PNGs and imports, calibration in `rivet_walk.gd` and `rivet_stride.gd`, unit-test updates, provenance and per-row measurements. Each changed-suite run finished with **3,795 passed, 0 failed, 2 skipped**. Quick lint and formatting passed. The changed runtime lines had zero eligible mutation operators.

The [six-weapon arena film](C:/Users/kazda/kiro/gtai-masters/n24/motion/legs_game_32.mp4) shows Gloria, rocket launcher, chainsaw, electro baton, assault rifle and hand cannon at 6.75 and 9.3 m/s. `ffprobe` verified **1920×1080, 60/1 fps, 38.000 s, 2,280 frames**. All 192 before/after sample pairs matched on gameplay tick, position and speed. The [manifest](C:/Users/kazda/kiro/gtai-masters/n24/motion/frames.json) includes the film and all twelve stills.

Scratch fell from **19.45 GB to 64.77 MB**, freeing **19.39 GB**. The published outputs, measurements and capture scripts remain available.

